# JB Siksha Institute - Environment Configuration Example
# If you integrate dynamic forms (e.g. EmailJS, Web3Forms, Formspree),
# place your public keys or secure endpoint URLs here instead of hardcoding them.

# Example: Public Access Keys (Safe for Client Bundle)
# JS_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your-public-access-key-here
# JS_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your-emailjs-public-key-here

# Example: Private Secret Keys (MUST remain server-side / serverless only)
# PRIVATE_CRM_API_KEY=your-private-crm-key-here
